        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1. When a teacher takes Long Term leave, however designated, it is understood that the person replacing that teacher shall be employed for a specified period depending upon the length of leave taken by the teacher.",
            "block_bbox": [
                59,
                99,
                489,
                171
            ],
            "block_id": 1,
            "block_order": 2,
            "group_id": 1,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    59.0,
                    99.0
                ],
                [
                    489.0,
                    99.0
                ],
                [
                    489.0,
                    171.0
                ],
                [
                    59.0,
                    171.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2. A teacher who is appointed as a replacement for a teacher on Long Term leave shall be notified in writing at the time he is employed that he is replacing a teacher on leave and that he can expect no additional employment beyond the time specified for that leave.",
            "block_bbox": [
                58,
                172,
                490,
                260
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 3,
            "group_id": 2,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    58.0,
                    172.0
                ],
                [
                    490.0,
                    172.0
                ],
                [
                    490.0,
                    260.0
                ],
                [
                    58.0,
                    260.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3. Such temporary employees shall be issued contracts and shall be members of the bargaining unit.",
            "block_bbox": [
                58,
                261,
                488,
                297
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 4,
            "group_id": 3,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    58.0,
                    261.0
                ],
                [
                    488.0,
                    261.0
                ],
                [
                    488.0,
                    297.0
                ],
                [
                    58.0,
                    297.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "4. It is anticipated that teacher replacements necessitated by long-term leaves shall be annual contract teachers employed for that specific purpose. When the time period of the employment expires, such replacements shall be treated as applicants for teaching positions. Said teachers shall be sent a copy of the May 6th updated list of vacancies.",
            "block_bbox": [
                58,
                297,
                489,
                404
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 5,
            "group_id": 4,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    58.0,
                    297.0
                ],
                [
                    489.0,
                    297.0
                ],
                [
                    489.0,
                    404.0
                ],
                [
                    58.0,
                    404.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "5. If requested by the replacement teacher, the Personnel Department shall send to said teacher the May 6th updated list of vacancies.",
            "block_bbox": [
                57,
                404,
                489,
                458
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 6,
            "group_id": 5,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    57.0,
                    404.0
                ],
                [
                    489.0,
                    404.0
                ],
                [
                    489.0,
                    458.0
                ],
                [
                    57.0,
                    458.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "F. When a teacher is returning from leave, the following will apply:",
            "block_bbox": [
                34,
                458,
                479,
                478
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 7,
            "group_id": 6,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    34.0,
                    458.0
                ],
                [
                    478.0,
                    458.0
                ],
                [
                    478.0,
                    477.0
                ],
                [
                    34.0,
                    477.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1. It is understood that a teacher returning from Long Term leave shall be initially reassigned to the school from which he originally took leave and shall be considered as if he were a part of that school staff. Compliance with contractual terms which relate to transfers, reductions in force, or other matters shall be premised upon this understanding. No new teacher shall be hired for such vacancies until any teacher desiring to return early from leave has been placed in accordance with Article XX, Section A. 2. c. (3).",
            "block_bbox": [
                58,
                477,
                490,
                620
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 8,
            "group_id": 7,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    58.0,
                    477.0
                ],
                [
                    490.0,
                    477.0
                ],
                [
                    490.0,
                    620.0
                ],
                [
                    58.0,
                    620.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2. It is, however, expressly understood that if a teacher takes uninterrupted Long Term leave or leaves in any combination which extend beyond the equivalent of two (2) normal school years, that he may be placed in an appropriate vacancy at locations other than the school to which he was assigned at the time of the initial leave. Should a teacher on Long Term leave return for a period of less than one (1) teaching month and be granted additional Long Term leave, he shall be considered for purposes of this understanding to have taken the equivalent of a combination of Long Term leaves.",
            "block_bbox": [
                55,
                620,
                490,
                798
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 9,
            "group_id": 8,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    55.0,
                    620.0
                ],
                [
                    490.0,
                    620.0
                ],
                [
                    490.0,
                    798.0
                ],
                [
                    55.0,
                    798.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "G. The following provisions shall apply to the transfer of teachers:",
            "block_bbox": [
                33,
                797,
                469,
                816
            ],
            "block_id": 9,
            "block_order": 10,
            "group_id": 9,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    33.0,
