            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2. The Board, upon recommendation of the Superintendent, may involuntarily transfer a teacher to another worksite provided written notice is given to the teacher five (5) duty days prior to the effective date of the transfer during the normal school year or fourteen (14) calendar days during the summer. Such transfers",
